                        // `<button>` (e.g. "Copy JSON") don't belong in the copy. So
                        // skip `<button>`/`<input>` entirely and strip markdown
                        // wrappers like `<strong>` to their text content. (Nitpick
                        // #1 from majkinetor on #87: previously the summary read
